infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Two inspector modes, one timing call
  desc --inspect lets code run now; --inspect-brk freezes before line 1 so a startup bug can't outrun the attach
  compares
    - label --inspect
      children
        - label Code runs immediately
          desc Agent is on, but execution starts at once
        - label Async attach has latency
          desc A fast startup crash ends before the client connects
        - label Best mid-flight
          desc Attach to a long-running server you catch in the act
        - label Full live toolkit
          desc Conditional breakpoints, watch, REPL in the paused frame
    - label --inspect-brk
      children
        - label Breaks before line 1
          desc Parks the process until a debugger attaches and resumes
        - label Blocks boot until attached
          desc You wait, but nothing can outrun the attach
        - label Best for startup bugs
          desc Module top-level, run-once code, boot crashes
        - label Same toolkit once paused
          desc Identical breakpoints and stepping after it continues
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
